{
  "id": "LUK.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 16",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haghweadoocheanda milmili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha ginealangaaschi, “Ghayi gwanda siyagi was meanang'ocheanda nea gwandeawa haghweadoocheanda ak iidu geataw meanang'oocheandida iita gidasaksaktaayda haghweadoocheanda haleanjeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguursa niny siidida ak gwayeesha, ‘Ng'asheesu eayiinyayi aba badaydaang'uun naaha? Goona iita mooneeda haleanjeedeanyu bea haghweadoocheanduumeadaang'u, aba gideaba maygudu huwa haghweadoocheanda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha geaw haghweadoocheanda, ‘Gaydasin naaha, aba gideaba siideanyu haw gagasa gageandeawaneani haghweadoocheanduumeeda? Meandeawani uurda jea dabwara ng'eanyi, ak ghaawali musiischooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea naanyaschi gichea dasin, ak abeeda ghwadeaptanaan buuneeda aba gealga nyaawa iisigeandeawanean haghweadoocheanda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Gaguursa fuga mideawa siileeniga siida haw ak gaguuriisiinagi ak gwayeesha siida madeeda, ‘Gindeawi siileeni deanaan bea siida haw?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, ‘Ghadeat bughala bea nagheeda.’ Hean gwayeesha niny, ‘Nukwa siileadaang'u lamwaja apteada ak ging'waari haradam ea damanamughuush.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha nuut, ‘Ang'iing'i gindeawi siileeni deanaan?’ Gwayeesha, ‘Guniyaji bughala bea ngaano.’ Gwayeesha niny, ‘Nukwa siileadaang'u ng'oara seedam.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagwarsa Siida haw haghweadoocheandida sina ng'asheega munyasiin, aba gideaba orjoogeaba ng'eanyiini ea bareahi iheeni aba jeedeaba rooproobang'su ea ghang'al fuga abiita heedeesh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geayeeshiineegwa, asisiina geat rooroocheeda aba meanang'oocheanduumeeda mwadoabiiwa, ama ashealaneegwa gil, ghwadeaptaneegwa aba jeeda giibinda manda muudeanooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida doabiiwaat aba haleanjeeda manang'i muuchi gajea doabiiwaat eara aba haleanjeeda heesi muuchi; nea dea miidoabiiwaat aba haleanjeeda manang'i eara aba gea heesi gajea miidoabiiwaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iimoowoosi doobiiweadi aba meanang'oocheanduumeeda mwadoabiiwa, gaygagooneegwa ng'eaha meanang'oocheanduumeeda huumwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iimoowoosi doobiiweadi aba haleanjeemba sih nuut, gaygagooneegwa ng'eaha haleanjeedida was geagwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda soomjeanda jea ghoamu gagadiiyeesa fiisu hees iyeenya, aba gideaba gayghwasit nih ak ghabwariiy nih, ghana ghoang'waay geat sea nih ak gafool nih. Moamuusi agadiyeesiina ASEETA ea meanang'oocheanduumeeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asha suuk bea Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Farisaayajeega ng'asheesu seaniin gwashika niny aba gideaba saawa ghabwariiy lapiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha saawa, “Agooga goohindi geat gili oowooschi miyaasiin aba madeeda buuneeda, nea ASEETA ghwanal gurooruunatkeagwa; nea gilinyoo goodiing'u geaw aba madeeda buuneeda, gayghoanyareas ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Deaweedajeega ea sibanga ea gagul Yohana; hean geerukwiida Giijaasta miy bea sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA, nea gaba siisi abwasaay geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajeawusus ng'ateayda jea ghang'ata humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida, mayghwasam gideaba gayghwasuunya ng'asheanjagi mwanang' was deaweeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida wassean nung' gatmoadaanyi ak ghayi nuut siisi gamealuul, ak siida jea ghaghi gatmooda sinung' earada siisi gamealuul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meanang'oocheanda ea Lasaro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghayi gwanda meanang'oocheanjagi akweali hang'weaka oomng'i bea sheayeeda haw ak gwasina ghweelmeeda galeagasean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gwanda ghuuteaba gheanyi siisi bwarbwar siguura Lasaro, nea gwandeawa deaneaduutka saang'a, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inyeesa gagasa ghwaak lajanga abituuna heeda agiischeewa meanang'ocheanda, nea inyeesa ghapka gudajeega gameera deaneaduutkaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghami siidida bwarbwariin, ak ghwaat malaykajeega ea ghoahiita madeeda Abrahamu. Muchu ghami eara meanang'oocheandida ak geebuy; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gatgat gheanyangaaschi meanang'ocheanda nea gwanda heeda abiita fuga nimeewa nea gwanda jeeda hang'weanidooda, ghwadaah Abrahamu nea sheagi nea Lasaro gwanda madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguurda nea gwayeesha, ‘Bwaabwa Abrahamu, samsean ajeakni Lasaro ghang'uda mooneadaanyi jeeda beega, googarbiit ng'ushapteanyu aba gideaba geasawani aba jeedeapeasi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Abrahamu, ‘Orjeedeanyu, apkaada gideaba ang'iing'i ninyasi haleanjeeda miyaasiin aba jeeda eaweagaagu, nea Lasaro ghwanyas gea munyas, ak ghamneawa niny geenung' ghahawda, nea ang'iing'i gindi jeeda hang'weanidooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuut gicha, dageascheedeanya ea agooga ea siyiin ghalalayda haw, aba gideaba fuga gasa ghapka hooweani oondiini ea mayghoamu, nea eara fuga meatkweedeang'wa ea maygoogeawu heeda sindi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, ‘Ada abeeda ghweandeanyu, geamuscheey, ajeaksiina fuga ghaheanya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba geandeawi orjoogiyya muut, eerukusa ea mwapka eara saawa hiji bea hang'weanidoodean.’ ",
